<script>
const TEST_QUESTIONS = [
  {
    num: 1,
    instruction: 'Read the list and answer the question.',
    imgSide: '<div class="q-passage"><p><strong>Famous Figures in Science</strong></p><p><strong>Astronomy:</strong> Nicolaus Copernicus</p><p><strong>Biology:</strong> Louis Pasteur</p><p><strong>Physics:</strong> Albert Einstein</p><p><strong>Mathematics:</strong> Archimedes</p></div>',
    question: 'Which scientist studies matter, energy, and their interactions?',
    options: ['Nicolaus Copernicus', 'Louis Pasteur', 'Albert Einstein', 'Archimedes'],
    ans: 'C'
  },
  {
    num: 2,
    instruction: 'Look at the visual and complete the sentence.',
    imgSide: '<img src="test3/q2.jpg" alt="Man using a telescope">',
    question: 'The man is using a telescope because it allows humans to ----',
    options: [
      'learn more information about space.',
      'treat dangerous bacterial infections.',
      'find the correct way during a sea journey.',
      'produce small and cheap microchips.'
    ],
    ans: 'A'
  },
  {
    num: 3,
    instruction: 'Read the speech bubbles and answer the question.',
    imgSide: '<div class="q-passage"><p><strong>Beren:</strong> I want to visit the new laboratory. I love doing experiments.</p><p><strong>Asya:</strong> Scientists always search for the truth about the natural world.</p><p><strong>Dila:</strong> My friend, Milana, is reading a book about the achievements of Isaac Newton.</p><p><strong>Erva:</strong> My brother, Osman, is doing research in the library at the moment.</p></div>',
    question: 'Who is currently performing an action to find specific information?',
    options: ['Beren', 'Asya', 'Dila\'s friend', 'Erva\'s brother'],
    ans: 'D'
  },
  {
    num: 4,
    instruction: 'Read the text and answer the question.',
    imgSide: '<div class="q-passage"><p>Early computers were massive. They were the size of a room and could only perform simple calculations. In 1958, Jack Kilby invented the microchip. This achievement changed everything. Scientists produced smaller and more powerful computers with microchips. In the 1970s, technology became cheaper. Finally, people began to use computers at home for personal tasks and games.</p></div>',
    question: 'According to the text, what was the result of the invention in 1958?',
    options: [
      'Computers became larger and more expensive.',
      'It helped scientists to reduce the size of computers.',
      'People stopped using calculators in their daily lives.',
      'Everyone began to carry room-sized computers in their pockets.'
    ],
    ans: 'B'
  },
  {
    num: 5,
    instruction: 'Complete the dialogue with the BEST option.',
    imgSide: '<div class="q-passage"><p><strong>Secretary:</strong> High-Tech Science Center. How can I help you?</p><p><strong>Recep:</strong> Hello. I\'d like to speak to Mr. Gökalp, please.</p><p><strong>Secretary:</strong> ----. He is conducting an experiment in the lab at the moment.</p><p><strong>Recep:</strong> OK. I will call back in an hour.</p></div>',
    question: null,
    options: [
      'Hold on a second',
      'He has gone out',
      'I\'ll put you through',
      'Don\'t hang up the phone'
    ],
    ans: 'A'
